{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54388","headline":"献江西锺令公 · 刘望","name":"献江西锺令公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"负笈蓬飞别楚丘，旌旄影里谒文侯。\n即随社燕来朱户，忽听鸣蝉泣素秋。\n岁月已嗟迷进取，烟霄只望怨依投。\n那堪思切溪山路，家苦簟瓢泪欲流。\n（录自民国廿九年刊龙赓言纂《万载县志·诗徵》）（按：题下原注：「以下采《嘉定志》补。\n」《嘉定志》当指宋林护新嘉定十三年纂《宜春志》十卷集八卷。\n原书久佚，《永乐大典》收入，清人尚有采撷，今不传。\n详《中国古方志考》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘望","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}